DESCRIPTION:Sun October 25\, 2026\nPainted Post\, NY 14870 US Directions\n
 Trails\, Tricks and Treats Race\nPrice: $27.50\nincl. $2.50 Fee\nTime: 10:
 00AM EDT - 12:00PM EDT\nRegistration ends October 24\, 2026 at 6:00pm EDT
 \nSign Up\n9620 Dry Run road\nPainted Post\, NY US 14870\nThis event will 
 be a fundraiser for SOAR but open to the public and any ages. There will b
 e a 2 hour time limit for everyone to run as many laps as they can in that
  time - rain or shine! We will have four different trails so you can choos
 e your lap distance. When you register you will get one ticket to our raff
 le baskets. During the race for each lap you complete you will get a ticke
 t to put toward the raffle baskets and also some other treats along the wa
 y. We will have some fun activities for those that don't run the whole two
  hours\, a chili cookoff\, and a costume contest. Bring the whole family\,
  dress up and come out and have fun! This year's race will again be held a
 t The Y at Watson Woods (formerly Watson Homestead) and will be on grass a
 nd trails.\nPrizes:\nAdults: Cash prizes for top male and female (most dis
 tance covered)\nYouth: Goodr sunglasses for top male and top female finish
