DESCRIPTION:This is a special Halloween matinee Movie\, selected to give y
 ou the shivers! No need to sign up\, just show up.\nThe movie will be: The
  Univited\, 1944\, 1h39m. Directed by Lewis Allen and starring Ray Milland
 \, Ruth Hussey\, and Donald Crisp. The film is based on Dorothy Macardle
 ’s novel Uneasy Freehold (1941)\, which was published in the United Stat
 es as The Uninvited (1942) and is part of a cycle of supernatural-themed f
 ilms that began appearing in the mid-1940s.\nThe Plot: a brother and siste
 r purchase a house in Cornwall\, England\, that is plagued by paranormal e
 vents.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78
 486418/20261029140000
