 \nThe Medicinals - 10:00 PM to 11:30 PM\n21 & Over\n______________________
 _________\nThe Medicinals are a 9 piece band that was forged out of a mutu
 al love and respect for reggae music. The current line-up\, established in
  2023\, is led by Dylan Savage\, known for his work as co-vocalist and gui
 tarist of Giant Panda Guerilla Dub Squad. Their live set includes songs fr
 om his original catalog such as "Live And Travel” which was featured on 
 the CBS show "Hawaii 5-0" and “Nice Feeling" which can be heard on the N
 etflix show "Bloodlines".\nInspired by classic roots reggae and modern Ame
 rican reggae sounds\, the band's latest single\, "Brand New Day" (featurin
 g Joshua Swain of The Movement)\, is being received very well across all p
 latforms and continues an upward trajectory this summer. The song joins pr
 eviously released singles "Reach You" and "Love The Sound" on Jackson Yard
  Records. Together\, these releases capture the timeless essence of the ge
 nre while offering a fresh\, distinct perspective that resonates with both
  dedicated fans and new listeners.\nThe Medicinals have had the pleasure o
 f sharing the stage with such national touring acts as: Joan Jett & the Bl
 ackhearts\, Julian Marley\, Sublime (with Rome)\, The Wailers\, Bumping Ug
 lies\, Kabaka Pyramid\, Black Uhuru\, Lettuce\, John Brown's Body\, Donna 
 the Buffalo and Sophistafunk to name a few.\nwww.medicinalsmusic.com\n____
 ___________________________\nWhether it's Delta Blues\, Ragtime\, Travis p
 icking\, or old-time music Raed delivers incredible interpretation\, virtu
 osity and authenticity.\nhttps://ithacamusic.net/org.php?id=483\nEvent by 
 The Medicinals\nBike Bar Ithaca\n314 E State St Suite 100\n\nSource: FLXca
 lendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78487425/20261030200000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78487425/20261030200000
END:VEVENT
