CATEGORIES:Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Event by Finger Lakes Rail Experience\n210 W Williams St\, Wat
 erloo\, NY\nPublic\nFINGER LAKES PHANTOM FLYER\nThis family-friendly\, hou
 r-long round trip departs from Waterloo and invites ghosts\, goblins\, and
  their grown-ups to experience Halloween on the rails. Costumes are highly
  encouraged — and may even earn you glory in our onboard costume contest
 .\nAlong the way\, young passengers can sip Harmony’s Mystic Mocktail\, 
 a color-changing\, lemonade-based concoction brewed especially for the occ
 asion\, and enjoy candy from our conductor’s friendly ghost.\nBeyond you
 r window\, deep forests and open water create a moving postcard of one of 
 New York’s most celebrated regions.\nBuilt in the 1940s and 1950s\, our 
 historic passenger cars pair vintage character with modern comfort for an 
 experience that is equal parts nostalgic\, scenic\, and delightfully spook
 y.\nTickets are $25 for grown-ups and $19 for children. Costumes\, curiosi
 ty\, and a taste for Halloween mischief are encouraged.\nTickets: https://
 flxrailexperience.com/finger-lakes-phantom-flyer/?fbclid=IwY2xjawUhvx1leHR
 uA2FlbQIxMABwZG9mBXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4Os1DhIIuy3sCkc
 TVpaMBsFg1a_zHakOSrhoSeG_kZvF08pY4CYX5hnMhXsw_aem_CJ7bkmoKKrPpt2gFqe357g.
 \n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78473574
 /20261031110000
